    "description": "Submit an existing product (already listed on TikTok Shop) as a response to a specific opportunity lead. The product will be linked to the opportunity and enter the standard submission review flow.\nIf you need to list a new product to meet the opportunity lead, you must first request the product release API to create the product_id , and then submit the product to link the opportunity lead."
